# Cloudflare Turnstile site key for the comment form (public; safe to commit).
# It is baked in when the client is BUILT (npm run build), so set it on the
# host before the build runs. It must belong to the same widget as the
# server's TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY, or every comment is rejected.
# Development test key that always passes: 1x00000000000000000000AA
# Leave empty to hide the widget (development only; production needs the check).
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
